          <div>
            <div class="kicker">Resume</div>
            <h1>Education &amp; experience.</h1>
            <p>Currently studying AI Engineering in Madrid while shipping production agents and starting empirical research. The short version below — the long version is on the <a href="/about" style="color:var(--coral);">about page</a>.</p>
