            <div class="resume-col">
              <h3>
                <iconify-icon icon="ph:graduation-cap" width="18" height="18"></iconify-icon>
                Education
              </h3>
              <ol class="timeline">
                <li class="tl-item">
                  <div class="tl-when">2024 — Present</div>
                  <div class="tl-title">BSc, AI Engineering</div>
                  <div class="tl-where">Universidad Francisco de Vitoria, Madrid</div>
                  <div class="tl-body">Second-year undergrad in Sistemas de Inteligencia Artificial. Focus on representation learning, optimization, and applied research.</div>
                </li>
                <li class="tl-item" data-dot="purple">
                  <div class="tl-when">2026 — In progress</div>
                  <div class="tl-title">ARENA — Alignment curriculum</div>
                  <div class="tl-where">Self-paced</div>
                  <div class="tl-body">Working through transformer internals, mech interp, and RL chapters to bridge from builder to researcher.</div>
                </li>
                <li class="tl-item" data-dot="mint">
                  <div class="tl-when">2022 — 2024</div>
                  <div class="tl-title">Bachillerato — Science track</div>
                  <div class="tl-where">Bilbao, Spain</div>
                  <div class="tl-body">Started building agents on the side while finishing high school.</div>
                </li>
              </ol>
            </div>

            <div class="resume-col">
              <h3>
                <iconify-icon icon="ph:briefcase" width="18" height="18"></iconify-icon>
                Experience
              </h3>
              <ol class="timeline">
                <li class="tl-item">
                  <div class="tl-when">2025 — Present</div>
                  <div class="tl-title">Research-in-training</div>
                  <div class="tl-where">Independent — harness-ablation paper</div>
                  <div class="tl-body">Designing and running an empirical ablation study of agent-harness components. Hypotheses, design choices and null findings are posted here as research notes.</div>
                </li>
                <li class="tl-item" data-dot="yellow">
                  <div class="tl-when">2024 — Present</div>
                  <div class="tl-title">Production AI engineer</div>
                  <div class="tl-where">Freelance &amp; institutional</div>
                  <div class="tl-body">Shipping agentic systems end-to-end: Salesforce-integrated commercial agents, MCP servers with security-review loops, Android field assistants, multilingual institutional tooling.</div>
                </li>
                <li class="tl-item" data-dot="purple">
                  <div class="tl-when">2024</div>
                  <div class="tl-title">First production agent</div>
                  <div class="tl-where">University project → real deployment</div>
                  <div class="tl-body">Including the now-infamous fake-crypto incident shipped to 30 university teachers — the postmortem is in the blog.</div>
                </li>
              </ol>
            </div>
          </div>
